        <mxCell id="boundary" value="ONB-01/02/10 already establish the request, authority and current setup. Reuse valid evidence; create only missing settings.&#10;Later-phase work only. New enrolment or publication needs a contract requirement; initial Sage activation needs explicit authority.&#10;Private A → Private B remains gated by SPEC-SEI-014. Reconcile uncertain effects; preserve invoice origins and historical access." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
